    <Name>INT_2015_0110</Name>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2015_0110","fieldKey":"title"} -->
    <Title>Beyond a square that refuses to be a square</Title>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2015_0110","fieldKey":"date"} -->
    <Date>2015-03-27</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2015_0110","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Saoirse Mbeki talks about silence, in three coats of varnish. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as "…".</Description>
